[kg][lg][rj][sk][sm][kp][np][mp][hq][iq][jq][kq][ir][jr][kr][lr][mr][is][js]C[Kev [3k\]\: great game!
ptitlou [1d\]\: thanks Noel
irelandgo [?\]\: vERY GOOD. Thanks
ptitlou [1d\]\: Great game
irelandgo [?\]\: Yes i lft some bad aji thugh
irelandgo [?\]\: Well done.
ptitlou [1d\]\: yes, i was relying on this black territory to somehow shrink at one point
ptitlou [1d\]\: but it was tough
ptitlou [1d\]\: and tense
irelandgo [?\]\: Yes you lived underneath and then destroyed outside too
ptitlou [1d\]\: yes i guess without the q9 push trick playthe game was ultra close
irelandgo [?\]\: You alos did wel to counter my possible cuts at top 
ptitlou [1d\]\: yes the second peep was saving me from the cut so I felt quite ok in this area
ptitlou [1d\]\: so many things happened in this game
ptitlou [1d\]\: that was hard to identifiy the best choices
irelandgo [?\]\: yes so many different areas in play
ptitlou [1d\]\: that was a very interesting game
irelandgo [?\]\: Yes, many ways we could both have gone
ptitlou [1d\]\: I played on a real board to avoid playing too fast as I usually do on screen
irelandgo [?\]\: I could stare at screen forever on some of the moves...
ptitlou [1d\]\: I guess a 7d commentary would destroy most of our choices ;-)
irelandgo [?\]\: I'm sure
irelandgo [?\]\: Want to look back?
ptitlou [1d\]\: I am actually quite exhausted. What about doing another evening review ? That could be nice ?
ptitlou [1d\]\: Like another monday evening ?
irelandgo [?\]\: OK could do!
irelandgo [?\]\: Thaks, see you soon.
ptitlou [1d\]\: Thank you so much Noel, the three games were very exciting
irelandgo [?\]\: Yes excellent games. How's everything wih you?
ptitlou [1d\]\: Working too much! I have an IT day job and the restaurant during evening so no time
ptitlou [1d\]\: But having good craic !!
ptitlou [1d\]\: and you, always travelling ?
irelandgo [?\]\: Right. I'm busy too. Last trip was holidays so not always bad
ptitlou [1d\]\: haha!
irelandgo [?\]\: See you.
ptitlou [1d\]\: Well I hope to see you this year! 
ptitlou [1d\]\: bye
irelandgo [?\]\: bye
